      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Edgewater,_Maryland"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Edgewater’s name reflects its colonial roots, echoing the original London Town settlement.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
